Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,PZ,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.98,0:01:36.99,PZ,,0,0,0,,{\an7\fad(0,0)\fn@方正中雅宋_GBK\bord1\fs40\frz-90\3c&HC4C4C4&\pos(1875,127)}勇者辛美爾死後第　年\N北方諸國埃托維斯山地
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.98,0:01:36.99,PZ,,0,0,0,,{\an9\fad(0,0)\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\bord1\fs40\3c&HC4C4C4&\pos(1875,385)}29
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,PZ,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.05,0:12:28.06,PZ,,0,0,0,,{\an7\fad(0,0)\fn@方正中雅宋_GBK\bord1\fs40\frz-90\3c&HC4C4C4&\pos(1875,127)}勇者辛美爾死後第　年\N北方諸國要塞都市海茲
